{"sourceUrl":"https://guoguan.xmu.edu.cn/info/1033/18460.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:03.550142+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://guoguan.xmu.edu.cn/info/1033/18460.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div><p><span><span>厦门大学</span></span><span><span>南洋研究院</span></span><span><span>关于202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年招收推荐免试研究生预报名的通知</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院简介</span></span><span><span>：厦门大学国际关系学院/南洋研究院前身为1956年由中国华侨事务委员会创办的南洋研究所，是我国最早设立的东南亚研究机构之一，也是最早从事区域与国际问题研究的学术单位之一。学院长期致力于区域国别研究，聚焦东南亚等重点地区，强调“语言+专业+区域”的复合型人才培养，科研与教学并重，学术资源丰富，具有鲜明的国际化与交叉学科特色。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请专业</span></span><span><span>介绍</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>区域国别学。区域国别学是教育部近年来推动建设的新兴交叉学科，主要围绕特定国家或地区开展深入研究，注重语言能力与专业知识的融合。我院重点聚焦东南亚区域，强调外语能力、田野调查与跨学科研究相结合，培养具有国际视野、通晓区域事务的复合型人才。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>具有坚定的社会主义理想信念，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>普通全日制应届</span></span><span><span>本科毕业生</span></span><span><span>，学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新能力和培养潜质。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>外语水平要求：全国大学英语六级考试成绩达到425分及以上，或全国大学英语四级成绩达到500分及以上。若申请者无法提供全国大学英语四、六级成绩或成绩不达标，TOEFL、GMAT、GRE 或雅思考试成绩达到总分的60%及以上亦可。第一外语为其他语种的，需提供等同全国大学英语四、六级、TOEFL、GMAT、GRE或雅思考试的成绩证明。申请者的本科专业为外语类专业的，其外语水平达到相应的专业外语等级即可。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>二、申请程序</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）申请流程</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日至</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日，申请人可登录厦门大学推免生管理系统（</span></span><a href=\"https://ssyjsbm.xmu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://ssyjsbm.xmu.edu.cn/</span></span></a><span><span>），填写有关信息、提交预报名申请并上传附件材料，上传附件材料后表示报名申请成功。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．待</span></span><span><span>教育部开通“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）后，所有申请我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>，且通过我院考核并取得所在学校推免资格的考生须在教育部系统中进行报名确认，并在规定时间内完成接收、确认我校复试及待录取通知等网上录取程序，否则申请视为无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）申请材料</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人应提交以下书面申请材料：</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>《厦门大学202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试攻读研究生申请表》（通过厦门大学推免生管理系统生成并打印）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>两位副教授及以上专家的推荐信。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单原件1份（含学业排名证明，须加盖所在学校教务部门或所在院系公章）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单原件。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>能够体现自身学术水平、科研能力的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等其它材料。有学术科研成果（发表的论文、出版的专著或承担的课题等）和获奖证书者，请提供</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>身份证原件。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>学生证原件。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>8.考生自述（主要包括考生本人的政治表现、外语水平、业务和科研能力、研究计划等方面内容，不超过两页，正反双面打印）。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>请将以上材料按照</span></span><span><span>1-</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>项顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M）上传报名系统。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三、其他事项</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>我院将根据学科特点和相应培养要求，结合申请人的报名信息进行综合评估，择优确定入围考核名单。</span></span><span><span>入围</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span>拟</span></span><span><span>通过</span></span><span><span>邮件</span></span><span><span>或短信</span></span><span><span>发送</span></span><span><span>。收到通知的申请人根据我院安排参加考核，未入围考核的申请人不再另行通知。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>具体考核时间和安排另行通知。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>本报名通知如与上级部门和学校相关文件要求不同，以上级部门和学校相关文件为准。</span></span><span><span>未尽事宜按</span></span><span><span>上级部门和学校</span></span><span><span>相关文件规定执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>四、联系方式</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>厦门大学</span></span><span><span>南洋研究院</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0592-</span></span><span><span>2188207</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>LH0715</span></span><span><span>@xmu.edu.cn</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>学院网站:</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>https://guoguan.xmu.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://nanyang.xmu.edu.cn/</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>南洋研究院</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"071b9e52de68ad663e3b1235530a1a4f78144bb1890bbb62fa6b8b0383638fa7","textLength":1596,"sourceSha256":"74f6c858737902fc02cf87156186aef9b8fc3d1c31da253460df6c4d8a618e2c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0d813a5574fd3b81221c","title":"2025年厦门大学国际关系学院南洋研究院关于2026年招收推荐免试研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:03.550142+00:00"}
